**Bug found and fixed.**

In `src/sim.ts` line 43, the condition was:
```ts
if (foodSurplus >= 0) {
```

This meant population grew even when food production exactly equaled consumption (surplus of 0). Changed to:
```ts
if (foodSurplus > 0) {
```

Now population only grows when there's an actual food surplus (production strictly exceeds consumption).


